/Title (Through regular reading series, mindful haiku walks, and publication launches, we strive to are dedicated to celebrating serving our community through action. Our collaborations with organizations like Camden FireWorks, Sacred Heart, Mighty Writers and Rutgers University ensure mindful writing is accessible throughout our home city. The Virgilio Writers House is proud to be a NJ Literary Landmark, as established by the NJ Center for the Book.)
