/Title (I think that in the often hectic world of my students, haiku offers a respite where they can ponder a memory or settle into the here-and-now. Condensing and compressing the language they use to convey the experience brings them a sense of wonder along with the desire to share their life experience with others. In the classroom haiku builds a sense of community, offering all the opportunity to be seen and heard.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 786 0 R
/Prev 915 0 R
>>
